{"800080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rising Sun - Iron Aces", "steam_appid": 800080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3529340], "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/800080/extras/d6f7a8f07425ffd38dca0c89e1c98c04.avif?t=1772346349\" width=616 height=178 /></span><br>After the Second World War, a large amount of<br>ex-combatants without a place to return were recruited by<br>a mercenary army under the command of former General Albert Hessler,<br>a man without a nation and with only one objective … war.<br><br>In response to this, the United Nations through the SDU(Special Defense<br>Unit), creates a group under the name of VALKYRIAS.<br>This squad, made up of elite pilots, will have the<br>responsibility to stop Hessler’s ambitions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><strong>Story mode</strong><br> • Fight through 12 stages.<br> • Play Cooperative or Solo.<br> • 3 difficulty levels.<br> • Select between four (4) different pilots, each pilot have an unique introductory level.<br> • 9 aircrafts to Unlock and upgrade.<br><br><strong>Game Mechanics</strong><br>Rising Sun have four different type of game mechanics.<br><br><i>Normal Mode</i><br>Traditional Shoot 'em up mechanics.<br><i>Boss Mode</i><br>Battle against heavy armoured enemies.<br><i>Dogfight Mode</i><br>Shooter on rails mechanics.<br><i>Attack Mode</i><br>Flight to your objective evading enemy attacks.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/800080/extras/9b6e3c74e908f909c8fef198efeb50b0.avif?t=1772346349\" width=616 height=353 /></span>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/800080/extras/d6f7a8f07425ffd38dca0c89e1c98c04.avif?t=1772346349\" width=616